 /> Cooking instructions use verbs in the Imperative form. <br />The Imperative is the verb in the base form. You do not use a subject."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":9,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Image\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"chop\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to cut something into small pieces\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn4le04ob03img01.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"fry\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to cook in a pan over the stove with oil\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn4le04ob03img02.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"grill\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to cook using a barbecue\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn4le04ob03img03.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bake\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to cook in the oven\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn4le04ob03img04.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"boil\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to heat a liquid until it becomes gas\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn4le04ob03img05.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"add\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to put more of something\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn4le04ob03img06.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"measure\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to determine the quantity of something\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn4le04ob03img07.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"pour\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to move a liquid from one container to another\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn4le04ob03img08.jpg\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Chop some onions."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Fry them with garlic."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Then, add tomatoes, water and spices.  "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "onion "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a strong tasting ingredient common in many dishes "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Just chop some onions."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le04ob03aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you hear when you follow cooking instructions."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "garlic  "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a small plant with a strong taste "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Then, fry the onions with garlic."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le04ob03aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to chop "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to cut into small pieces "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Can you chop this tomato, please?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le04ob03aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to fry  "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to cook in a pan with oil over the stove "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Fry the onions in the pan."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le04ob03aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "meal  "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the things we eat and drink together at a specific time of the day"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: When do you normally have your meals?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le04ob03aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "spice  "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "ingredients you add to food to increase the flavor"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What spices do you put in the spaghetti sauce?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le04ob03aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "oregano   "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a spice used in Italian food"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  I put oregano, salt and pepper in the sauce."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le04ob03aud04"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le04ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Look on the internet for English recipes from 2 different countries. Read the cooking instructions for each recipe."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make a list of the verbs in the Infinitive."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make a list of the spices. "}, {"type": "text", "content": " Decide which recipe you want to try."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Show your recipe to a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I read and understand English recipes from other countries."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I identify cooking actions and spices used."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I share the recipe with a partner."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welc